  name: Po and Lina
  defaultMaterial: {fileID: 2100000, guid: 6026d4d8c7409a642b93bf1b98c343e7, type: 2}
  ingredient: 3
  ingredientDislikes: 2
  skillOffer: 2
  skillNeeded: 6
  st01_ingredientText: "Hey, Po and I just stubled upon on your kitchen. Can we stay
    for a bit?\t"
  st01_ingredientDislikeText: But I don't like aubergines. And Lina doesn't like
    aubergines. So none of those, please.
  st01_skillOfferText: We are just around. So we do a little bit of this and a little
    bit of that. But only after school.
  st01_skillNeedText: 'Lina had a big fight with our parent this morning. I don''t
    know how to make it better. Our birthday is in a week, we need to make up. '
  st03_soupResultText: The veggies mixed well together, thank you!
  st03_skillOfferText: We are around, so we can feed the kitties. Maybe even give
    them a little pet!
  st03_skillNeedText: We had a fight with our parents about our birthday party. Adult
    think it is really that hard to get 2 ponnies for us?
